WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Yimisa rimba endhawini yo rhelela kutani u funga laha ntambhu yi tsemakanyaka nhonga kona.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Rhendzelekisa rimba leswaku milenge yi cincana tindhawu eka tindhawu timbirhi leti fanaka swinene, kutani u funga nakambe.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.667
Mfungho wa ku ringanana wu le xikarhi ka mimfungho leyimbirhi.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:32.417
Rhurhisa nenge lowun'wana u wu tlhandlukisa kumbe u wu rhelelisa ku kondza ntambhu yi hayeka ehenhla ka mfungho wa ku ringanana.
